"description":"CleanClip – Clean Links Before You Share\n\nCleanClip helps you turn messy copied URLs into cleaner, more privacy-friendly links.\n\nWhenever you copy a link, CleanClip can detect it, remove common tracking parameters, and show you the cleaned result. You can preview the link in the app, copy it, or share it right away.\n\nSimple, fast, and built for people who want cleaner links without extra noise.\n\nFeatures\n\n• Automatically detects copied URLs\n• Removes common tracking parameters like utm_source, fbclid, igshid, si, and more\n• Cleans sharing links from Instagram, Threads, Facebook, YouTube, X, Reddit, and more\n• Smart site-specific rules that remove tracking without breaking links\n• Share extension to clean links from any app\n• Shows which parameters were removed and which were kept\n• Shows whether your clipboard holds the original or the cleaned link\n• Preview cleaned links inside the app before sharing\n• Copy or share cleaned links with one tap\n• Option to remove all URL parameters\n• Customizable rule groups, custom parameters, and excluded domains\n• iCloud Sync keeps your cleaning rules the same on all your devices\n• App language selection\n• Clean, minimal interface\n\nPrivacy First\n\nCleanClip cleans your links fully on your device.\n\n• No account required\n• No analytics\n• No trackers\n• No data sent to our servers\n\nYour clipboard content is processed locally. CleanClip does not upload, collect, or track your links. Optional iCloud Sync stores only your cleaning rules in your own iCloud account — your links and history are never synced.\n\nWho It’s For\n\nCleanClip is useful for:\n\n• Anyone who wants cleaner URLs\n• Privacy-conscious users\n• People who often share links in messages, email, or social apps\n• Marketers, creators, and developers who work with URLs often\n• Anyone tired of long, messy tracking links\n\nCopy a link. Clean it. Preview it. Share it with confidence.", "averageUserRating":0, "trackCensoredName":"CleanClip", "trackViewUrl":"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/cleanclip/id6744323660?uo=4", "contentAdvisoryRating":"4+", "bundleId":"com.peterlee.CleanClip", "userRatingCount":0}, 
