"description":"Clean, Optimize, and Secure Your Phone with Cleaner\n\nSay goodbye to clutter and wasted storage! Cleaner is the ultimate app to clean, organize, and optimize your phone effortlessly. Whether you need to delete duplicates, merge contacts, or secure private files, Cleaner helps you take control of your storage with powerful tools and an easy-to-use interface.\n\nKey Features\nOptimize Storage: Identify what’s taking up space and clean it with AI. Get detailed insights on your storage before and after cleanup.\nDelete Duplicates: Quickly clean duplicate photos, videos, and files to free up space instantly.\nSwipe to Keep or Delete: Manage your files easily with a swipe. Choose what stays and what goes to maintain an organized device.\nMerge Duplicate Contacts: Eliminate duplicate entries in your address book and keep your contacts neat.\nCompress Videos: Save space by compressing large video files without losing quality.\nClean Your Inbox: Streamline your emails by removing outdated messages, spam, and cluttered promotions.\nOrganize Videos: Find and sort videos quickly, and delete unwanted clips to reclaim space.\nHide Private Files: Secure your sensitive photos, videos, and files in a password-protected vault.\nEnjoy Charging Animations: Add fun, modern charging animations to personalize your phone experience.\n\nWhy Choose Cleaner?\nSimple to Use: The user-friendly design makes cleaning and organizing effortless.\nPowerful Tools: Includes advanced features like video compression, contact merging, and inbox cleaning.\nFast and Effective: Quickly scans and cleans your phone in seconds.\nSecure and Reliable: Protects your sensitive files with password-protected folders and a privacy-first approach.\n\nHow Cleaner Helps You\nBoosts Performance: Removes unnecessary files and frees up storage to keep your phone running smoothly.\nProtects Your Privacy: Locks private files and ensures your sensitive data is safe.\nSimplifies File Management: Manage contacts, emails, and videos effortlessly with intuitive tools.\nSaves Time: Automates cleanup tasks so you can focus on what matters most.\n\nHow to Get Started\nDownload: Install Cleaner from the App Store.\nScan Your Phone: Let Cleaner analyze your storage and files.\nReview and Clean: Decide what to delete, compress, or secure.\nExplore Advanced Features: Try inbox cleaning, video compression, contact merging, and more.\nEnjoy a Cleaner Phone: Experience the benefits of a faster, more organized device.\n\nJoin Millions of Happy Users\n\nCleaner has transformed the way people manage their phones. From freeing up storage to safeguarding private files, Cleaner offers the ultimate solution for keeping your device clean, secure, and running smoothly.\n\nDownload Cleaner Now\n\nDon’t let clutter slow down your phone. Download Cleaner today and enjoy a smarter, faster, and cleaner phone experience!\n\n\nPrivacy Policy: https://static.cleanerai.co/privacy-en.html\nTerms of Use: https://static.cleanerai.co/terms-conditions-en.html", "averageUserRating":4.57960999999999973653075358015485107898712158203125, "trackCensoredName":"Cleaner: Photo Cleanup", "trackViewUrl":"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/cleaner-photo-cleanup/id6502456017?uo=4", "contentAdvisoryRating":"4+", "bundleId":"com.codespaceapps.cleanerv2", "userRatingCount":45232}, 
