"description":"Dolphin Cleaner: The Smarter Way to Free Up Storage and Boost Performance!\n\nIs your iPhone running slow? Are you constantly battling the dreaded \"Storage Almost Full\" notification? You need the ultimate cleaner app designed specifically for iOS.\n\nDolphin Cleaner is your all-in-one mobile companion. Using advanced AI, we help you declutter your photo library, optimize your device, and secure your digital life. Go beyond basic photo cleanup—get the speed and space you deserve!\n\n\nDolphin Cleaner Core Features (Smart AI Tools):\n\n1. FAST CLEAN – The One-Tap Master\n\nSmart AI Photo Cleanup: Automatically detect and remove all duplicate photos, similar videos and blurry images. Free up space with intelligent image recognition instantly.\n\nOne-Tap Speed Up: Instantly speed up your phone and clear unnecessary background data directly from your home screen with a single tap.\n\nClutter Management: Clean up screenshots, large files, and outdated media that is wasting your precious storage space.\n\n2.CONTACTS CLEANER – Address Book Organizer\n\nDuplicate Contact Merger: Automatically detect and merge contacts with matching names or phone numbers to eliminate duplicates and declutter your address book.\n\nIncomplete Contact Cleaner: Quickly identify and remove \"ghost\" contacts that are missing names or phone numbers, keeping your contact list streamlined and professional.\n\n3. COMPRESS – Storage Optimizer\n\nVideo Compressor: Reduce the file size of large video recordings without significant loss of quality. Optimize your video library to save significant storage space on your device.\n\n4. SPEED TEST – Performance Analysis\n\nInternet Speed Test: Check your current Wi-Fi or cellular connection speed to ensure optimal performance.\n\n5. SECRET SPACE – Ultimate Privacy Vault\n\nPrivate Album Vault: Keep your most sensitive photos and videos safe in a protected, password-locked Secret Space.\n\n\nPrivacy & Security – Your Data Stays Yours\n\nUnlike other cleaner apps, all our cleaning and processing is performed locally on your device. We do not upload or share your personal data. Your privacy is our top priority.\n\nDownload Dolphin Cleaner now and take control of your iPhone storage and speed!\n\n\nSubscription Terms\n\nYou can subscribe for unlimited access to all features of Dolphin Cleaner.\n\nPayment will be charged to your iTunes account upon confirmation of purchase.\n\nSubscriptions automatically renew unless auto-renewal is turned off at least 24 hours before the end of the current term.\n\nRenewal fees will be charged to the account no later than 24 hours prior to the end of the current term.\n\nSubscriptions can be managed, and auto-renewal can be turned off by going to the User's Account Settings after purchase.\n\nBy using Dolphin Cleaner, you agree to our Privacy Policy and Terms of Use:\n\nPrivacy Policy: https://www.goconnectproxy.com/privacy1\n\nTerms of Use: https://www.goconnectproxy.com/Paperplane", "averageUserRating":4.62568000000000001392663762089796364307403564453125, "trackCensoredName":"Dolphin Cleaner: Cleanup Space", "trackViewUrl":"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/dolphin-cleaner-cleanup-space/id6474177068?uo=4", "contentAdvisoryRating":"4+", "bundleId":"com.superwhitecleaner.killtrash", "userRatingCount":2196}]
